{
  "comment": [
    "Cross-language behavioral contract for device-clock normalization: how a session's",
    "device->host offsets are derived, and where each log lands on the host timeline.",
    "Implemented twice, because the profiler runs in a browser over raw JSON and cannot call the",
    "Kotlin one: `deviceClockOffsets()` / `normalizedMs()` in TrailblazeLogClockNormalization.kt",
    "(every Kotlin reader — LogsRepo, the recording generator, session info, the session viewers),",
    "and `deviceClockOffsets()` / `logOffsetMs()` in run-report-extract.ts (the interactive report and",
    "its profiler). Consumed by ClockNormalizationParityFixturesTest (Kotlin) and perf-extract.test.ts",
    "(TS). Change a derivation rule in both implementations AND here, in one change — a drift makes",
    "a session's profile and its recording disagree about where a device's spans sit.",
    "",
    "Encoding: `timestampMs` / `hostReceivedAtMs` are epoch ms (each side converts to its own",
    "timestamp type); absent `durationMs` means 0; absent `deviceName` means the log carries none,",
    "which both sides collapse to ONE key, spelled \"\" in `expectedOffsets.byDeviceName` — unless a",
    "host-clock tool log naming a device (a handover, dated at its completion) preceded its",
    "`hostReceivedAtMs`, which keys it to that device, or it is a non-tool log whose `traceId` a",
    "tool log carries, which keys it to that tool's device. `type` is `tool` for a TrailblazeToolLog",
    "(the only class that anchors an offset; `toolName` defaults to `tapOn`, `successful` to true),",
    "`snapshot` for a TrailblazeSnapshotLog (a traced non-tool log), and `status` for any other log",
    "class. `expectedOffsets: null` means the session yielded no offsets at all.",
    "",
    "Not covered here, deliberately: a log with NO `clock` field. The TS side falls back to the log",
    "class for those (`MaestroDriverLog` == device), which is the only signal a pre-field log",
    "carries; Kotlin has no such fallback. That asymmetry is pinned in perf-extract.test.ts alone."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "an all-host session yields no offsets, even when its tools were anchored",
      "logs": [
        { "id": "start", "type": "status", "clock": "host", "timestampMs": 10000, "expectedHostMs": 10000 },
        {
          "id": "tap",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "host",
          "timestampMs": 11000,
          "durationMs": 500,
          "deviceName": "emulator-5554",
          "hostReceivedAtMs": 14500,
          "expectedHostMs": 11000
        }
      ],
      "expectedOffsets": null
    },
    {
      "name": "one anchored device tool sets its device's offset",
      "logs": [
        { "id": "start", "type": "status", "clock": "host", "timestampMs": 10000, "expectedHostMs": 10000 },
        {
          "id": "tap",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 8000,
          "durationMs": 500,
          "deviceName": "emulator-5554",
          "hostReceivedAtMs": 11500,
          "expectedHostMs": 11000
        }
      ],
      "expectedOffsets": { "byDeviceName": { "emulator-5554": 3000 }, "sessionWideMs": 3000 }
    },
    {
      "name": "the least-delayed upload wins, not the average and not the worst",
      "logs": [
        {
          "id": "prompt-upload",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 8000,
          "durationMs": 500,
          "deviceName": "emulator-5554",
          "hostReceivedAtMs": 11500,
          "expectedHostMs": 11000
        },
        {
          "id": "slow-upload",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 9000,
          "durationMs": 500,
          "deviceName": "emulator-5554",
          "hostReceivedAtMs": 14500,
          "expectedHostMs": 12000
        },
        {
          "id": "batched-upload",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 10000,
          "durationMs": 500,
          "deviceName": "emulator-5554",
          "hostReceivedAtMs": 30000,
          "expectedHostMs": 13000
        }
      ],
      "expectedOffsets": { "byDeviceName": { "emulator-5554": 3000 }, "sessionWideMs": 3000 }
    },
    {
      "name": "two devices keep independent offsets; an unanchored tool takes its own device's, a non-tool log the session-wide one",
      "logs": [
        {
          "id": "seller-tap",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 8000,
          "durationMs": 500,
          "deviceName": "seller-emulator",
          "hostReceivedAtMs": 11500,
          "expectedHostMs": 11000
        },
        {
          "id": "buyer-tap",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 14000,
          "durationMs": 500,
          "deviceName": "buyer-emulator",
          "hostReceivedAtMs": 12500,
          "expectedHostMs": 12000
        },
        {
          "id": "unanchored-buyer-tap",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 15000,
          "durationMs": 500,
          "deviceName": "buyer-emulator",
          "expectedHostMs": 13000
        },
        { "id": "device-status", "type": "status", "clock": "device", "timestampMs": 20000, "expectedHostMs": 18000 }
      ],
      "expectedOffsets": {
        "byDeviceName": { "seller-emulator": 3000, "buyer-emulator": -2000 },
        "sessionWideMs": -2000
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "logs from a device that names itself and one that does not stay separate",
      "logs": [
        {
          "id": "unnamed",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 8000,
          "durationMs": 500,
          "hostReceivedAtMs": 11500,
          "expectedHostMs": 11000
        },
        {
          "id": "named",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 8000,
          "durationMs": 500,
          "deviceName": "seller-emulator",
          "hostReceivedAtMs": 12500,
          "expectedHostMs": 12000
        }
      ],
      "expectedOffsets": { "byDeviceName": { "": 3000, "seller-emulator": 4000 }, "sessionWideMs": 3000 }
    },
    {
      "name": "unnamed device logs belong to the binding the host had handed over to when it received them",
      "logs": [
        {
          "id": "before-any-handover",
          "type": "status",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 9500,
          "hostReceivedAtMs": 9000,
          "expectedHostMs": 9000
        },
        { "id": "to-front", "type": "tool", "clock": "host", "timestampMs": 10000, "deviceName": "front", "expectedHostMs": 10000 },
        {
          "id": "front-tap",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 8500,
          "durationMs": 500,
          "hostReceivedAtMs": 11000,
          "expectedHostMs": 10500
        },
        { "id": "front-frame", "type": "status", "clock": "device", "timestampMs": 8700, "hostReceivedAtMs": 11000, "expectedHostMs": 10700 },
        { "id": "to-back", "type": "tool", "clock": "host", "timestampMs": 12000, "deviceName": "back", "expectedHostMs": 12000 },
        {
          "id": "back-tap",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 12700,
          "durationMs": 500,
          "hostReceivedAtMs": 12700,
          "expectedHostMs": 12200
        },
        { "id": "back-frame", "type": "status", "clock": "device", "timestampMs": 13000, "hostReceivedAtMs": 12800, "expectedHostMs": 12500 },
        {
          "id": "failed-switch-to-front",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "host",
          "toolName": "switchDevice",
          "successful": false,
          "timestampMs": 13500,
          "deviceName": "front",
          "expectedHostMs": 13500
        },
        {
          "id": "back-tap-after-failed-switch",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 14000,
          "hostReceivedAtMs": 13600,
          "expectedHostMs": 13500
        }
      ],
      "expectedOffsets": { "byDeviceName": { "front": 2000, "back": -500 }, "sessionWideMs": -500 }
    },
    {
      "name": "a device-stamped session with no ingestion anchor reads raw",
      "logs": [
        { "id": "start", "type": "status", "clock": "host", "timestampMs": 10000, "expectedHostMs": 10000 },
        {
          "id": "tap",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 8000,
          "durationMs": 500,
          "deviceName": "emulator-5554",
          "expectedHostMs": 8000
        }
      ],
      "expectedOffsets": null
    },
    {
      "name": "a zero-duration tool anchors off its start alone",
      "logs": [
        {
          "id": "tap",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 8000,
          "deviceName": "emulator-5554",
          "hostReceivedAtMs": 11000,
          "expectedHostMs": 11000
        }
      ],
      "expectedOffsets": { "byDeviceName": { "emulator-5554": 3000 }, "sessionWideMs": 3000 }
    },
    {
      "name": "a log received before any handover belongs to the device the session started on",
      "logs": [
        {
          "id": "start-tap",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 8500,
          "durationMs": 500,
          "hostReceivedAtMs": 11000,
          "expectedHostMs": 10500
        },
        {
          "id": "start-frame",
          "type": "snapshot",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 8700,
          "hostReceivedAtMs": 11100,
          "expectedHostMs": 10700
        },
        {
          "id": "to-back",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "host",
          "timestampMs": 12000,
          "deviceName": "back",
          "toolName": "switchDevice",
          "expectedHostMs": 12000
        },
        {
          "id": "back-tap",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 12700,
          "durationMs": 500,
          "hostReceivedAtMs": 12700,
          "expectedHostMs": 12200
        }
      ],
      "expectedOffsets": { "byDeviceName": { "": 2000, "back": -500 }, "sessionWideMs": -500 }
    },
    {
      "name": "a driver log that uploads after the next switch keeps the device of the tool it was captured under",
      "logs": [
        {
          "id": "to-front",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "host",
          "timestampMs": 10000,
          "deviceName": "front",
          "toolName": "switchDevice",
          "expectedHostMs": 10000
        },
        {
          "id": "front-tap",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 8500,
          "durationMs": 500,
          "hostReceivedAtMs": 11000,
          "traceId": "t-front",
          "expectedHostMs": 10500
        },
        {
          "id": "to-back",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "host",
          "timestampMs": 12000,
          "deviceName": "back",
          "toolName": "switchDevice",
          "expectedHostMs": 12000
        },
        {
          "id": "late-front-frame",
          "type": "snapshot",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 8800,
          "hostReceivedAtMs": 12100,
          "traceId": "t-front",
          "expectedHostMs": 10800
        },
        {
          "id": "back-tap",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 12700,
          "durationMs": 500,
          "hostReceivedAtMs": 12700,
          "traceId": "t-back",
          "expectedHostMs": 12200
        }
      ],
      "expectedOffsets": { "byDeviceName": { "front": 2000, "back": -500 }, "sessionWideMs": -500 }
    },
    {
      "name": "a host wrapper that switches devices hands over when it finishes, not when it starts",
      "logs": [
        {
          "id": "to-front",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "host",
          "timestampMs": 9000,
          "deviceName": "front",
          "toolName": "switchDevice",
          "expectedHostMs": 9000
        },
        {
          "id": "wrapper",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "host",
          "timestampMs": 10000,
          "durationMs": 3000,
          "deviceName": "back",
          "toolName": "checkoutFlow",
          "expectedHostMs": 10000
        },
        {
          "id": "front-tap",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 8500,
          "durationMs": 500,
          "hostReceivedAtMs": 11000,
          "expectedHostMs": 10500
        },
        {
          "id": "switch",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "host",
          "timestampMs": 12000,
          "deviceName": "back",
          "toolName": "switchDevice",
          "expectedHostMs": 12000
        },
        {
          "id": "back-tap",
          "type": "tool",
          "clock": "device",
          "timestampMs": 12700,
          "durationMs": 500,
          "hostReceivedAtMs": 12700,
          "expectedHostMs": 12200
        }
      ],
      "expectedOffsets": { "byDeviceName": { "front": 2000, "back": -500 }, "sessionWideMs": -500 }
    }
  ]
}
